  "description": "Excel (.xlsx) read/write for GM.Documents — reports and exports across GM.* services. Writes spreadsheets from a library-neutral SpreadsheetDefinition (sheets, typed cells, headers) and reads existing workbooks back into plain rows, behind IDocumentGenerator<SpreadsheetDefinition> and IExcelReader. Built on ClosedXML (MIT), chosen deliberately over EPPlus — whose v5+ Polyform Noncommercial licence requires a paid commercial licence past a usage tier. ClosedXML types don't leak to consumers. Register with AddGMDocuments().AddExcel().",
